["er.request/1",{"arguments":{"body":"## Outcome\n\n`validate --against` a revision without a tree store skips V2 with one line; an `aep.project/3`\ntree store renders `aep.planning-md/2` and an `aep.project/2` store keeps `/1`, with S5 comparing\neach document against the render of its own tag.\n\nDesign: `docs/design/planning-on-entity-runtime-v0.1.md` § 8 and § 13 A5.\n\n## Decisions\n\n- `/2` is the tag change only. § 3.2's `head` key has no defined value and is not written.\n- A `/1` projection of a tree store stays valid until its next write re-renders it; each\n  repository gets one `aep plan artifact render` commit when its planning check moves to the\n  release that renders `/2`.\n","document":{"events":[{"args":{"command":"record-evidence","kind":"test_result","reference":"git:beyond10x/aep@6c6285f9a","source":"aep-cli 647, aep-backend-markdown 174, aep-planning-migration 56 passed; tree_validate_against 3, tree_projection_format 2; clippy and fmt clean","target":"ent-cf6155cda1766ffbc92a724dcf7eafa2"},"changed":{},"entity":"aep.entity","from_state":"active","id":"ent-cf6155cda1766ffbc92a724dcf7eafa2","payload":{"actor":"human:timo","at":1790266762000,"causation":"cmd-child-7dba16968e58087e5db69576df80f005b0bbcea4547efcc4b84b3e538d8dd992","correlation":"protocol-artifact-evidence","event_id":"aep.entity:ent-cf6155cda1766ffbc92a724dcf7eafa2@3#0~936e8332416d15d3","executor":null,"recorded_at":"2026-09-24T16:19:22Z"},"revision":3,"to_state":"active","type":"aep.evidence.record/v1","version":1}],"fields":{"$aep":{"archived":false,"metadata":{"created_at":1790266724349,"id":"ent-cf6155cda1766ffbc92a724dcf7eafa2","locator":"ep://planning/store/story/tree-projections-render-planning-md-2","provenance":{"created_by":"human:timo","updated_by":"human:timo"},"revision":3,"type":"aep.story/v1","updated_at":1790266753126}},"body":"## Outcome\n\n`validate --against` a revision without a tree store skips V2 with one line; an `aep.project/3`\ntree store renders `aep.plann